/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 730 Tm
([Empirical Evaluation on GLUE and WikiSQL]) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 702 Tm
(5 Empirical Experiments: We evaluate the downstream task performance of LoRA on) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 687 Tm
(RoBERTa, DeBERTa, GPT-2, and GPT-3 175B across the GLUE benchmark, WikiSQL, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 672 Tm
(SAMSum datasets. In the Transformer architecture, we follow Vaswani et al. \(2017\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 657 Tm
(and apply LoRA to the Self-Attention projection matrices W_q and W_v.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 624 Tm
(On GPT-3 175B, LoRA matches or exceeds the full fine-tuning baseline on WikiSQL) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 609 Tm
(\(achieving 74.0% accuracy\) and MultiNLI \(achieving 91.7% accuracy\) while updating) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 594 Tm
(only 4.7M parameters compared to 175,255M parameters in full fine-tuning, reducing) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 579 Tm
(VRAM memory consumption from 1.2 TB to 350 GB.) Tj
ET
endstream
